{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"MediaWiki REST revision HTML, sanitized","nodeCount":270,"content":[{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwAQ"},"children":[{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[]}]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwAw"},"children":[{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwBQ"},"children":[]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwBw"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Scale"},"children":["Scale"]},"\n"]},{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwCA"},"children":["\n\n\n"]},{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[]},{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwCg"},"children":["\n\n"]},"\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwDA"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Description"},"children":["Description"]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Scale"]}," is a status effect which alters the health, size and speed of an enemy."]},"\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwDw"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Mechanics"},"children":["Mechanics"]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["When an enemy receives ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Scale"]},", its health, speed and size will be altered either temporarily or permanently. This can be both positive, like a speed boost or negative, like a health decrease. By default, the values were 50% more health, 50% size increase and its speed being set to 75%, though these values are rarely used."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Scale"]}," still exists in the game, though it has mostly been replaced by ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Nimble","title":"Nimble"},"children":["Nimble"]}," and ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Bloated","title":"Bloated"},"children":["Bloated"]}," attributes."]},"\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwFg"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Enemy_List"},"children":["Enemy List"]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["No enemy spawned with ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Scale"]}," naturally."]},"\n